menu "CampusPulse upload scheduling"
config CP_PIPELINE_PSRAM_BANKS
    bool "Allocate collector banks and frozen upload workspaces in PSRAM"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3 && SPIRAM
    default n
    help
        Explicitly allocate both core/bin banks and immutable upload read buffers
        with SPIRAM and 8-bit capabilities, without internal-memory fallback.
        Bank replacement is transactional and occurs only with ingress stopped.
        Disabled boards keep their static core banks and existing allocation path.

config CP_UPLOAD_PREFER_CURRENT_BOOT
    bool "Prefer current-boot batches over historical backlog"
    default n
    help
        Within each stream, keep the oldest pending batch first separately for
        current-boot and historical records. Upload eligible current-boot heads
        before historical heads. Retry-delayed current heads leave capacity for
        history. This does not discard, modify or acknowledge stored bodies.
        Adds one boolean per journal slot; disabled builds retain their existing
        scheduler memory layout and ordering.
endmenu
